      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-09"
        },
        "markdown": "# 1 · Existential Stakes Hook\n## 0:00–3:43\n\nLionel repeatedly asks whether viewers would risk even one American service member for war with Iran. He contrasts the scale of that question with the show's usual Tyler Robinson and Erica Kirk material and warns about retaliation, supply disruption, and preparedness. \n\n**Function:** rank the new subject above the show's established concerns and force the audience to confront the cost personally.\n\n**Existing moves:** `States Thesis`, `Ranks Stakes`, `Directs Audience`.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786076913184,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study09-seg2",
