        "markdown": "# 2 · Thematic Sponsor Bridge\n## 3:43–5:04\n\nThe opening discussion of retaliation, food supplies, generators, and emergency preparation flows directly into a My Patriot Supply advertisement about war, shipping disruption, power failures, and long-term food storage. \n\n**Production grammar:** the sponsor is not merely inserted after the hook; its subject is semantically continuous with the hook.\n\nThis reinforces the `thematic sponsor transition` observed earlier.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786076913184,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study09-seg3",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "3 · Three-Story Warning Bundle",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
