      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-09"
        },
        "markdown": "# 3 · Three-Story Warning Bundle\n## 5:04–15:23\n\nLionel says his earlier confidence that the situation would calm down has failed and then explicitly presents **three developments from the previous 48 hours** as a combined warning. \n\nThe bundle consists of:\n\n1. statements about retaliation against energy infrastructure\n2. cyber incidents involving American water systems\n3. modernization of Selective Service and mobilization infrastructure\n\nHe asks viewers to place the three stories next to each other before judging the situation. \n\n**Function:** accumulate separate observations into one argument without making any one source the episode's spine.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786076913184,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
