        "markdown": "# 8 · Live Poll and Audience Sampling\n## 46:19–54:52\n\nLionel asks the live audience to answer `1` for continued war with Iran and `2` for no, repeatedly requesting only the number. He then uses the audience as a conversational partner while asking what would make the public take the danger seriously. \n\nHe also asks what happened to Trump's earlier anti-war posture and invites viewers to help generate explanations. \n\n**New production refinement:** live chat is not only a navigation trigger. It can operate as a **polling and hypothesis-sampling channel**.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
