      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-09"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧬 Observed Grammar\n\n**raise existential stakes -> thematic sponsor -> admit changed assessment -> bundle three warning stories -> define national-interest standard -> personalize cost through children and draft -> invoke historical precedent -> map political realignment -> restate thesis as reversal -> take adversary perspective -> poll audience -> sample hypotheses -> return to central warning -> autobiographical memory -> community close**\n\n## Episode family\n`Lionel Thesis Monologue`\n\n## Sequence controller\n`thesis`\n\n## Navigation mode\n`mostly-linear`\n\n## Support structure\n`evidence-bundle`\n\nThis is best treated as a **crisis-briefing configuration of the thesis-monologue family**, not a new composition family.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786076913184,
