          "angle": 180
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-09"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🧺 New Refinement · Evidence Bundle\n\nStudy 09 uses several contemporary stories as a deliberate **bundle** supporting one proposition.\n\nThis differs from:\n\n- a `Media Queue`, where moving to the next source controls episode sequence\n- a `Source Timeline`, where one outside source supplies the rails\n- an `Evidence Audit`, where individual evidence items are tested for sufficiency\n\nHere:\n\n`Story A + Story B + Story C -> cumulative warning`\n\nThe three stories remain individually identifiable but are rhetorically evaluated as a set.\n\nA lightweight shared primitive may be useful:\n\n## `Evidence Bundle`\n\nPossible fields:\n\n- member items\n- bundle claim\n- selection rationale\n- time window\n- ordering\n- cumulative interpretation\n\nThis is a structural refinement, not a new Lionel class.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786076913184,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study09-navigation",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Important Disconfirmation · Live Is Not Branch-and-Return",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": 440,
        "y": 540
      },
      "width": 710,
