        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-09"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🔬 Comparison Across Nine Studies\n\n## 01 · Thesis Monologue\nThesis-controlled, mostly linear.\n\n## 02 · Hosted Forensic Commentary\nEvidence audit inside another host's container.\n\n## 03 · Annotated Media Reaction\nSource timeline controls sequence.\n\n## 04 · Adversarial Media Audit\nOpponent argument becomes the inspected object.\n\n## 05 · Curated Media Mosaic\nMedia queue controls sequence.\n\n## 06 · Live Associative Monologue\nLive thematic thread with branch-and-return navigation.\n\n## 07 · Preventive Scenario Monologue\nThesis family plus scenario simulation.\n\n## 08 · Layered Live Monologue\nBranch-and-return repeats with multiple persistent storylines.\n\n## 09 · Crisis Briefing Thesis Monologue\nLive container, thesis-controlled sequence, mostly-linear navigation, cumulative evidence bundle.\n\n## Important result\nStudy 09 does not expand the family list. It **cross-combines properties already discovered** in a configuration we had not yet observed.\n\nThat is exactly what a compositional grammar should do.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786076913184,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lionel-study09-model",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Current Compressed Grammar After Nine Studies",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 1230
      },
      "width": 780,
      "height": 730,
      "ports": [
        {
