      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "lionel-validation-study-09"
        },
        "markdown": "# 🗜️ Current Compressed Grammar After Nine Studies\n\n## Container\n- Lionel-owned recorded\n- Lionel-owned live\n- guest appearance inside another host's container\n\n## Sequence controller\n- thesis\n- evidence audit\n- host interaction\n- source timeline\n- opponent argument\n- media queue\n- live thematic thread\n\n## Navigation mode\n- mostly-linear\n- serial\n- source-bound\n- queue-driven\n- branch-and-return\n\n## Support structures\n- evidence bundle\n- actor field\n- media queue\n- thread set\n- research funnel\n- coalition\n\n## Stable rhetorical operations\n- frame\n- define standard\n- audit evidence\n- add context\n- analogize\n- identify pattern\n- map actors\n- comment on media\n- model another perspective\n- simulate scenario\n- synthesize\n- qualify uncertainty\n- personalize stakes\n- incorporate audience\n\n## Production roles\nSponsor, poll, chat input, live presence, programming announcement, continuation, community close.\n\nNine messy specimens now reduce to a fairly small compositional system.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1786076913184,
